  pages        = {483--492},
  date         = {2025-10-25},
  abstract     = {Protein-protein interactions are at the core of all key
                  biological processes. However, the complexity of the
                  structural features that determine protein-protein
                  interactions makes their design challenging. Here we present
                  BindCraft, an open-source and automated pipeline for de novo
                  protein binder design with experimental success rates of
                  10-100\%. BindCraft leverages the weights of AlphaFold2 (ref.
